Chủ đề: Frontend React
Câu hỏi: What are components in React?
Trả lời: Components are building blocks of a React app. They define parts of the UI.
- Functional components → written as functions.
- Class components → written as ES6 classes.

```
// Functional Component function Greeting() { return <h1>Hello World</h1>; }
```


